{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">吉利汽車9月新車銷量按年增長近百分之7，按月增長百分之8，超過29萬輛，當中出口量10.6萬輛，按年增長1.6倍。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">累計今年首9個月，銷量223.5萬輛，按年增長百分之3。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T00:39:52.264026+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}